# Client-supplied working documents. The repository is PUBLIC — anything committed
# here is published, so this folder stays out of it.
documents/

# Internal working material, untracked 2026-08-11 for the same reason as documents/ above.
# These are how the build is run, not part of the site, and the repository is PUBLIC.
#   CLAUDE.md — working method and project rules. It always DESCRIBED itself as gitignored;
#               it simply never was, so this restores the documented intent.
#   notes/    — the build checklist plus client correspondence and copy drafts
#               (transcript-queries-for-client.txt, results-page-summaries-for-client.txt).
# ⚠ They still travel with the daily dated-folder copy, because that is a filesystem copy and not
# a clone. They will NOT come down with a fresh `git clone` — keep the folder copy as the record.
# ⚠ Untracking hides them from here on. It does NOT remove them from git history, which is public
# on a public repo. See notes/BUILD-CHECKLIST.md §9 for what that means for the gate password.
CLAUDE.md
notes/
